@startuml UML-RUNTIME-LIFECYCLE
title KnowledgeOS — Runtime Lifecycle
caption Architecture V3.0

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Created

Created --> Initializing
Initializing --> Validating
Validating --> Recovering : recovery required
Validating --> Ready : validation complete
Recovering --> Ready : recovery complete

Ready --> Foreground : user-visible activation
Foreground --> Background : application backgrounded
Background --> Foreground : application activated
Background --> Suspended : platform suspension
Suspended --> Recovering : process resumes with recovery
Suspended --> Foreground : resumable state still valid

Ready --> Degraded : optional capability unavailable
Foreground --> Degraded : capability degradation
Background --> Degraded : capability degradation
Degraded --> Ready : capability restored
Degraded --> Foreground : restored while active
Degraded --> Background : restored while backgrounded

Created --> Crashed
Initializing --> Crashed
Validating --> Crashed
Recovering --> Crashed
Ready --> Crashed
Foreground --> Crashed
Background --> Crashed
Suspended --> Crashed
Degraded --> Crashed

Created --> ShuttingDown
Initializing --> ShuttingDown
Validating --> ShuttingDown
Recovering --> ShuttingDown
Ready --> ShuttingDown
Foreground --> ShuttingDown
Background --> ShuttingDown
Degraded --> ShuttingDown

ShuttingDown --> Terminated
Crashed --> Terminated
Terminated --> [*]

note right of Ready
  Foundational safe operation is available.
  Optional capabilities may still be unavailable.
end note

note right of Suspended
  In-memory progress is not assumed durable.
end note

footer KnowledgeOS Architecture | UML | Version 3.0
@enduml
